flowchart TD
%% Page 11 of 11 — Stage 10. Sponsor report and renewal. §12, §13 step 12, §21 CampaignState.
    IN[/"FROM PAGE 10 · earnings settled"/]:::conn
    ST1["CampaignState · ACTIVE → REPORTING"]:::state
    K1["Results compiled per athlete and deliverable"]:::system
    K2["Every number names its source"]:::system
    K3["Campaign Manager reviews and releases it"]:::btg
    K4["Sponsor reads it, and prints or saves the file"]:::sponsor
    K5["Renewal opportunity created in Zoho, queued"]:::system
    ST2["CampaignState · COMPLETED"]:::state
    RENEW{"Sponsor<br/>renews?"}
    BACK[/"BACK TO PAGE 5 · a new brief"/]:::conn
    ENDX(["END · the §39 loop is complete"]):::term

    IN --> ST1 --> K1 --> K2 --> K3 --> K4 --> K5 --> ST2 --> RENEW
    RENEW -- "yes" --> BACK
    RENEW -- "no" --> ENDX
